      "text": "Criminal Original Petition filed under Section 482 of the\n Criminal Procedure Code to call for records in C.C.No.46 of 2019 in\n court of the Judicial Magistrate-I at Tiruvannamalai for offences p\n under sections 294(b), 418, 420 and 506(i) r/w120(b) of the Indian \n Code in Crime no. 21 of 2019 on the file of the 1st respondent and \n the same and render justice.\n For Petitioner : No Appearance\n For Respondent : Mr.A.Damodaran, Addl. Public Prosecut\n 1/3\nhttps://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis\n\n Crl\n Order",
